                "text": "At USDA, we know that food is medicine. At the @MilkenInstitute Future of Health Summit yesterday, I chatted with @hbottemiller about the groundbreaking progress USDA has made in promoting food and nutrition security, fighting diet-related disease, & ensuring no kid goes hungry. https://t.co/UXFfRtWhSp",
